WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:07.438
&gt;&gt; Bret: I DON'T USUALLY GIVE

00:00:07.439 --> 00:00:08.106
ADVICE BUT I THINK EVERYONE

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.609
SHOULD COUNT YOUR BLESSINGS.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.443
MY FAMILY IS TONIGHT.

00:00:12.444 --> 00:00:14.846
MY WIFE AMY AND SONS PAUL AND

00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:17.281
DANIELLE WENT SKIING COME OUT WE

