00:00:19.418 --> 00:00:21.285
FUN, GORGEOUS SNOW, QUALITY

00:00:21.286 --> 00:00:23.020
FAMILY TIMES.

00:00:23.021 --> 00:00:23.688
FUN SKIING WITHOUT INCIDENT

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:25.356
WHICH IS ALWAYS NICE.

00:00:25.357 --> 00:00:28.659
I DROVE THE FAMILY MONDAY

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.028
MORNING TO THE AIRPORT IN

00:00:31.029 --> 00:00:32.029
