00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:37.034
I COULD NOT STOP OUR SUV.

00:00:37.035 --> 00:00:38.736
WE SLID INTO THE INTERSECTION OF

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:41.205
A BUSY ROAD AND INTO THE PATH OF

00:00:41.206 --> 00:00:43.007
A BIG PICKUP TRUCK WHICH SLAMMED

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:46.677
