00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:29.053
IF THANK YOU HIGHWAY PATROL AND

00:01:29.054 --> 00:01:30.855
EMS PERSONNEL WHO WERE ALL

00:01:30.856 --> 00:01:31.422
AMAZING.

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:33.658
AS WE WERE RELEASED FROM THE

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:37.628
HOSPITAL, I TWEETED THIS.

00:01:37.629 --> 00:01:38.396
DON'T TAKE ANYTHING FOR GRANTED,

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:40.331
EVERY DAY IS A BLESSING.

00:01:40.332 --> 00:01:43.634
FAMILY IS EVERYTHING.

00:01:43.635 --> 00:01:46.003
IT'S ALWAYS GOOD TO REMIND

00:01:46.004 --> 00:01:48.240
YOURSELF OF THAT BEFORE

